Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.25,0:01:33.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下面是新闻时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:37.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚 御友岛附近海域发生了强烈地震
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.65,0:01:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,震中位于御友岛东南约一公里处
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:43.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,震源深度小于十公里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.45,0:01:47.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最大震度位于神奈川县藤泽市 震度五级以上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:50.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来让我们听听当地居民怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.65,0:01:53.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地震的时候您在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.95,0:01:56.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有怪兽 有两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:01:58.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…您…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:02:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海里站着巨大的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.85,0:02:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是您的错觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.35,0:02:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.85,0:02:11.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位居民的思维似乎有些混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.35,0:02:11.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吃好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:14.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第 2 话 Zearth
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是在海边放花 玩得入了迷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.35,0:02:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才没回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.15,0:02:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿姨 我吃好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.25,0:02:29.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吃好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:31.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:33.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样的话就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.85,0:02:35.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.45,0:02:37.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.25,0:02:38.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:41.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天真是担心死我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.65,0:02:43.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像已经有居民遇难了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:45.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让您费心了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来要去吉泽家 听说他家已经一塌糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:52.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我也去帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:56.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真是多谢了 这岛上老人太多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:02:58.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天上自习
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:02:58.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.85,0:03:00.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦您了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.75,0:03:04.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是平静不下来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:06.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.35,0:03:08.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来就轮到我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 那个男的是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:12.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…叫什么来着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.85,0:03:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可可贝利吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:17.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才有人说看到了那个机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.45,0:03:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 还有人在网上发帖子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.05,0:03:21.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.05,0:03:23.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有写我们的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:29.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能 全都没有证据 没人相信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:33.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…咱们还是好好商量一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.45,0:03:38.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 毕竟已经有人死了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.05,0:03:41.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如全都交代出来 就此不干了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.35,0:03:46.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果跟大人说了 应该能被接受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.65,0:03:48.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太无聊了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是毕竟是那么危险的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.95,0:03:54.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要不拿出点勇气让自己更吸引人的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是当不了女主播的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.95,0:03:57.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁让你多管闲事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:04:00.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可可贝利说过让我们保护地球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:03.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事也并不是非我们不可吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.85,0:04:06.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话是这么说没错…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.45,0:04:13.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒是挺想玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:15.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.95,0:04:17.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也玩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这件事是应该的 总还是不应该逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:26.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干吧 操纵那大机器人的是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:30.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能保护地球 我们就是英雄了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.65,0:04:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能保护话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.05,0:04:34.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看你…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.45,0:04:37.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有那么简单么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.85,0:04:42.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是游戏 你负得起责任吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:45.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是冷静下来考虑一下比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.15,0:04:49.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别误会 我也考虑了很多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要告诉爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.45,0:04:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…古茂田的爸爸是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:05:01.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古茂田的老爹是国会议员 这都不知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:03.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:07.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往住呢 能不能跟你爸爸说说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.05,0:05:09.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上新闻?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往住明的新闻特快?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收视率第一呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.15,0:05:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是怎么说呢 如果没有明确的证据的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:23.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是很难跟他开口
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:28.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…那个山洞算不算证据呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可可贝利住的那个山洞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:35.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那里挖出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.85,0:05:36.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.05,0:05:39.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是昨天我们已经看到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.95,0:05:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塌成那个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:50.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个山洞应该也在附近 肯定已经塌了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.05,0:05:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到现在还是无法相信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:02.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.35,0:06:07.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天早晨起来的时候 还觉得昨天的事情都是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.25,0:06:09.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:13.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别以为那是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:16.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁在说话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:23.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:24.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.75,0:06:26.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在空中飘着?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:28.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么什么“东西”啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:32.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我惹生气的话可不得了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说…说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.15,0:06:35.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是毛绒玩具吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:38.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了 是可可贝利的手下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.45,0:06:40.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 我才不是他手下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:49.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本大爷这么好心来照顾你们 怎么不知道心存感激
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.95,0:06:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来是提问时间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个机器人是从哪来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:13.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是从宇宙来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:15.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动力是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.75,0:07:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有报酬吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:20.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人全都那么恶心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.65,0:07:21.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么飘在空中的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:24.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你其实是毛绒玩具吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.05,0:07:25.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.15,0:07:30.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们难道连大爷我的名字都不问问吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.35,0:07:35.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些小鬼 根本不懂礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:37.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…你叫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.45,0:07:39.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本大爷叫 肥虫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:41.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肥料?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:44.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就先这么叫我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能退出战斗么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.55,0:07:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.25,0:07:58.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是已经定下契约了么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.25,0:08:06.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:08.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:11.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机器人里面么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.25,0:08:13.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是…什么都没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.45,0:08:22.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.95,0:08:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可可贝利的眼镜 没度数
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个机器人现在在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在在海里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:34.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过其实放哪都能藏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:37.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 这里有人没参加契约
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:47.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么所谓 孤立她不是太可怜了 大哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.65,0:08:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 你们的子弹已经上膛了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:08:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 应该有看着眼熟的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.45,0:09:07.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是…我的椅子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.05,0:09:09.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.45,0:09:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个大概…是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.65,0:09:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个老板椅…是谁的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:16.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是…我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.65,0:09:18.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么呀 坐垫?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.55,0:09:20.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真够穷酸的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.45,0:09:22.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连小孩坐的椅子都有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你家日子怎么过的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:29.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宽治的椅子好酷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:30.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你家有这样的椅子?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:37.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是妈妈最喜欢的 我也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.15,0:09:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:44.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.75,0:09:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:53.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.55,0:10:14.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才谁叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.45,0:10:15.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.65,0:10:18.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到声音了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:20.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…我就是驾驶员?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.55,0:10:48.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能不能请您再详细说说 震源深度为0是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.35,0:10:52.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我所在的大学得出的数据是这么显示的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太奇怪了吧 地震怎么会在海面上发生呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:59.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据现阶段的数据还得不出结论
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.25,0:11:00.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往住的爸爸挺能干的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.75,0:11:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 别靠这么近
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:12.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人写我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:31.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 睡不着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都睡不着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.35,0:11:35.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.25,0:11:39.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也好久没这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.35,0:11:45.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然想起来 以前只有比赛之前才会这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:48.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你放弃足球是真的了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:50.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是…因为需要时间去思考吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:01.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们队可是联赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.15,0:12:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.15,0:12:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决赛那天 有好多人来看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.95,0:12:13.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 我爸爸却没来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:15.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:20.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后一下子就没了热情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:26.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是喜欢足球呢 还是仅仅想吸引别人的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.75,0:12:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然被别人众星捧月似地对待 心里非常高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.45,0:12:35.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你反对这个游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:41.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你误会我了 觉得我只想吸引别人注意
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.95,0:12:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想去 不是想让别人注意我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:49.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实就算没人知道也好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:51.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.55,0:12:57.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要成为无名英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门司也一起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:08.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:10.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我再喊一次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.05,0:13:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的厉害!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:18.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和久 你胳膊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.45,0:13:20.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:26.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候粘上的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.45,0:13:33.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又出现了 御友岛前 比上次出现的时候还近
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然这么近
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:03.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样下去会有人遇难
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:04.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得赶快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在没有别的办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.35,0:14:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:34.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们 快坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:47.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可奈 你没椅子吧 坐这
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:54.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浮起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.65,0:14:57.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.25,0:15:08.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它只要用意念控制就会动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.75,0:15:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.35,0:15:17.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 这机器人叫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:19.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有名字
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.65,0:15:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.45,0:15:26.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样的话 我倒是想到一个合适的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:38.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听这个怎么样 我们要保护地球 所以就叫Zearth
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.05,0:15:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Zearth吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.75,0:15:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好酷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:43.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Zearth
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Zearth…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.45,0:15:49.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决定了 就叫Zearth
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.55,0:15:53.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人还在呢 先别商量了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.75,0:15:55.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 准备
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:57.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Zearth 出发!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动了!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:51.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这动作 好象有点傻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,操作很难的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:01.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快拍 快拍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:02.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次一定拍下来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就先发一炮试试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:19.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以喊么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你便
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.45,0:17:23.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,激光发射!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.85,0:17:30.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把山…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:32.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炸平了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:33.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且好像根本没伤到对方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.35,0:17:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和久 太过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:38.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:45.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这么悠闲的话会输哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 站起来!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:52.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站起来 Zearth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:00.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站起来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.35,0:18:15.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:18.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在正是精彩的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.65,0:18:22.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快放开 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.95,0:18:28.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这招不管用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会失败吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:39.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 肥虫 现在该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.65,0:18:44.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少命令我 而且驾驶员是你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:47.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:53.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和久 敌人脚跟上面的地方有破绽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.25,0:18:59.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 瞄准那里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.65,0:19:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么攻击 现在手被束缚住了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.55,0:19:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用手干什么 别忘了我是踢球的!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:39.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弱点在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:42.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下吧 已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.85,0:19:45.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经利落地把对方的弱点毁掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.55,0:19:53.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.45,0:19:57.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们赢了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:05.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能出去了么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.95,0:20:17.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.55,0:20:19.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.35,0:20:23.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和久 快点回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.25,0:20:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.95,0:20:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁着还没被发现 赶快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:45.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你丢不丢人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.35,0:21:04.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 我只是轻轻碰了一下 没推他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.15,0:21:10.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的 相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.55,0:21:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看什么看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.45,0:21:17.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.35,0:23:07.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和久真的死了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:12.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们不能回避的现实
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.65,0:23:16.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一回 秘密

